-- ⚔️ STYLE AWARENESS (Shidou / Dio / Luffy)
-- Recognizes which character the opponent is playing and adapts:
--   SHIDOU — double jump (aerial shots from above), Big Bang Drive,
--            Demon's Wings -> taller reach + lower bomb threshold
